{"seq":1,"slug":"dd-invoice-data-model-audit-rules","title":"滞箱费账单数据模型与自动稽核规则引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/invoice-audit-dispute-recovery/dd-invoice-data-model-audit-rules","wordCount":2982,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"滞箱费账单数据模型与自动稽核规则引擎\">滞箱费账单数据模型与自动稽核规则引擎</h1><p>一张 D&amp;D 发票到达时，通常是 PDF 里的一行行文字，或承运人门户里一条不可导出的记录。要判断金额对不对，必须先回答：免费期从哪天算、费率表是哪一版、码头放箱的时间戳是什么。把发票变成可稽核的对象，本质是把非结构化账单向一个<strong>字段完备、事件可追溯、规则可执行</strong>的数据模型做一次翻译，再让规则引擎在这套模型上自动重算与比对。本文讲的就是这次翻译的数据契约与规则分层。计费口径与责任归属的前提，见本 hub 的 <a href=\"../free-time-clock-event-tracking/dd-clock-model-container-event-timeline\">免费期时钟模型与集装箱事件时间线</a> 与 <a href=\"dd-liability-attribution-chargeback\">D&amp;D 费用责任归属与转嫁</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-发票是待验证的声明-不是既成事实\">核心概念：发票是待验证的声明，不是既成事实</h2><p>D&amp;D 账单的误差不是偶发的录入错误，而是结构性的。承运人按自己 tariff 计算，货主掌握的是码头作业事实，两边用的是<strong>两套时间戳、两套免费期口径、两套费率版本</strong>，任何一处错位都会反映到金额上——最常见的三类是免费期起算基准错误、抗辩时段未扣除、以及费率版本错用。</p>\n<p>监管层面，美国联邦海事委员会（FMC）已把「发票必须包含什么」变成硬性要求。2020 年发布的 Interpretive Rule on Demurrage and Detention（46 CFR Part 545）确立<strong>激励原则</strong>：收费目的在于促使货物流转，货物在不可提走期间被计费即属不当。2024 年 2 月发布、5 月 28 日生效的《Demurrage and Detention Billing Requirements》最终规则（46 CFR Part 541）进一步规定，承运人与码头运营方开具的 D&amp;D 发票<strong>必须列明</strong>一系列指定要素，否则收费无效——「发票字段是否齐全」本身就是一个可自动执行的稽核规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"账单数据模型-把一票-d-d-拆成五张事实表\">账单数据模型：把一票 D&amp;D 拆成五张事实表</h2><p>可稽核的账单模型不应围绕「一行发票」组织，而应围绕<strong>实体—事件—条款</strong>的关系组织。下面五张逻辑表足以覆盖一票典型 D&amp;D 稽核所需的所有字段，以提单号（B/L）与箱号（ISO 6346 编码）为连接键，把承运人的账、码头的事实、合同的条款粘在一起。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实体表</th>\n<th>关键字段</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>稽核用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发票头 InvoiceHeader</td>\n<td>发票号、承运人、开票日、币种、B/L、合同/tariff 版本号、付款期限</td>\n<td>承运人 EDI 810 / 门户导出 / PDF OCR</td>\n<td>判断字段完备性（FMC 46 CFR 541 合规）与费率版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发票行 ItemLine</td>\n<td>箱号、设备类型、进/出口标志、费用类别（Demurrage/Detention）、计费天数、单价、金额</td>\n<td>发票正文</td>\n<td>重算的比对对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件事实 ContainerEvent</td>\n<td>箱号、事件类型、时间戳、时区、数据源</td>\n<td>码头 TOS、EDI 315/322、DCSA Track &amp; Trace</td>\n<td>重算免费期与计费天数的唯一权威输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>免费期权益 FreeTimeEntitlement</td>\n<td>合同版本、天数、起算基准事件、日历口径（日历日/工作日）、暂停规则</td>\n<td>运输合同、tariff、FMC 规则</td>\n<td>计算应得免费期与可豁免时段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>费率表 TariffRate</td>\n<td>tariff 版本、生效窗口、设备类型、阶梯区间、每日费率</td>\n<td>公开运价本、合同附件</td>\n<td>按实际日期选取正确费率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>模型的关键约束是<strong>每个金额必须可回溯到一组事件与一个条款版本</strong>，无法回溯的金额标记为「不可验证」而非默认接受。事件表价值最高：承运人发票只有天数与金额，可核验时间戳来自码头 TOS（Terminal Operating System）或 DCSA Track &amp; Trace 标准（Digital Container Shipping Association 发布，定义 <code>Gate Out</code>/<code>Empty Return</code> 等机器可读事件），二者矛盾点正是引擎要捕捉的信号。事件表应为**只追加（append-only）**日志：同箱同事件若来自多源，保留多条并标注来源，由规则层处理冲突，而非入库时静默覆盖。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[发票 PDF/EDI 810] --&gt; B[结构化解析]&#10;  C[码头 TOS / EDI 315] --&gt; D[事件事实表]&#10;  E[运输合同 / Tariff] --&gt; F[免费期权益 + 费率表]&#10;  B --&gt; G[发票头 + 发票行]&#10;  G --&gt; H[稽核规则引擎]&#10;  D --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I{金额差异?}&#10;  I --&gt;|无| J[自动放行付款]&#10;  I --&gt;|有| K[差异归因]&#10;  K --&gt; L[争议申诉包]&#10;  L --&gt; M[追回 / 减免入账]\">graph TD\n  A[发票 PDF/EDI 810] --&gt; B[结构化解析]\n  C[码头 TOS / EDI 315] --&gt; D[事件事实表]\n  E[运输合同 / Tariff] --&gt; F[免费期权益 + 费率表]\n  B --&gt; G[发票头 + 发票行]\n  G --&gt; H[稽核规则引擎]\n  D --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I{金额差异?}\n  I --&gt;|无| J[自动放行付款]\n  I --&gt;|有| K[差异归因]\n  K --&gt; L[争议申诉包]\n  L --&gt; M[追回 / 减免入账]</pre><p>三个输入源（账、事件、条款）在规则引擎处汇合，是本模型与 Excel 对账的根本区别：Excel 把三者揉进一张表，模型保持它们可独立验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动稽核规则引擎的分层设计\">自动稽核规则引擎的分层设计</h2><p>规则引擎的核心问题不是「有几个规则」，而是「规则该在哪一层失败」。把不同性质的检查混在一层，或误放行（层级太低），或把可解释的差异变成黑箱（层级太高）。实践中有效的分层是五层，每层只负责一类判断，失败后流向不同处置通道。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>L1 结构完整性</strong>：发票是否含 FMC 46 CFR 541 要求列明的要素（箱号、B/L、免费期天数、费率、起算时间戳等）。缺字段即整票退回，是唯一允许「一票否决」的层。</li>\n<li><strong>L2 内部一致性</strong>：头金额是否等于行金额之和、行内「天数 × 单价」是否等于行金额、进位与币种是否自洽。失败标记为疑似录入错误。</li>\n<li><strong>L3 计费正确性重算</strong>：用事件表与合同条款独立重算应计天数与金额，与发票逐项比对。引擎的价值核心，唯一需要全部三张输入的表。</li>\n<li><strong>L4 合规抗辩匹配</strong>：检查是否存在可豁免时段——码头未放箱、清关卡住、承运人自身原因，对应 FMC 激励原则下的抗辩。命中即产生可申诉项。</li>\n<li><strong>L5 异常模式检测</strong>：跨票重复计费（同箱号同区间被两张发票覆盖）、费率高于合同、免费期为负值等。需历史数据，是唯一有状态的一层。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[发票入库] --&gt; B[L1 结构完整性]&#10;  B --&gt;|缺关键字段| R1[整票退回 要求重开]&#10;  B --&gt;|通过| C[L2 内部一致性]&#10;  C --&gt;|金额不自洽| R2[标记疑似录入错误]&#10;  C --&gt;|通过| D[L3 用事件与条款重算]&#10;  D --&gt; E{差异超过容差?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| F[自动放行付款]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| G[L4 合规抗辩匹配]&#10;  G --&gt; H[L5 跨票异常检测]&#10;  H --&gt;|命中异常| I[生成争议申诉包]&#10;  H --&gt;|未命中| J[人工复核队列]&#10;  G --&gt;|命中抗辩| I\">flowchart TD\n  A[发票入库] --&gt; B[L1 结构完整性]\n  B --&gt;|缺关键字段| R1[整票退回 要求重开]\n  B --&gt;|通过| C[L2 内部一致性]\n  C --&gt;|金额不自洽| R2[标记疑似录入错误]\n  C --&gt;|通过| D[L3 用事件与条款重算]\n  D --&gt; E{差异超过容差?}\n  E --&gt;|否| F[自动放行付款]\n  E --&gt;|是| G[L4 合规抗辩匹配]\n  G --&gt; H[L5 跨票异常检测]\n  H --&gt;|命中异常| I[生成争议申诉包]\n  H --&gt;|未命中| J[人工复核队列]\n  G --&gt;|命中抗辩| I</pre><p>规则本身应以声明式 DSL 表达，而非散落的 <code>if</code> 语句，因为规则需按承运人、港口、合同版本分别维护与版本化。一条 L3 规则的最小形态是四元组：<strong>适用条件 + 输入字段 + 计算式 + 判定阈值</strong>。例如「MSC 进口 40HC，免费期按 availability 起算，容差 0 天」，这样一条规则可在合同改版时被替换，而不触碰引擎代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"费率重算与差异归因\">费率重算与差异归因</h2><p>重算的数学形式并不复杂，难的是把每个量都落到可核验的字段上。设某箱的应计金额为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>recompute</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{\\text{recompute}} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} r_i \\cdot d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recompute</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是落在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个阶梯区间内的计费天数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该区间对应的每日费率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是实际触达的阶梯数。计费天数由免费期权益决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>billable</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>elapsed</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>suspended</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{billable}} = \\max\\bigl(d_{\\text{elapsed}} - f - d_{\\text{suspended}},\\, 0\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">billable</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">elapsed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">suspended</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>elapsed</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{elapsed}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">elapsed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是按合同日历口径统计的已流逝天数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是合同免费期，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>suspended</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{suspended}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">suspended</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 L4 抗辩规则豁免的天数。三个量都必须落到模型字段，缺一即重算失效——这正是「不可验证金额」标记的用武之地。</p>\n<p>把发票金额与重算金额相减，得差异 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>invoiced</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>recompute</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = A_{\\text{invoiced}} - A_{\\text{recompute}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">invoiced</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recompute</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 是货主多付部分（潜在追回额），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 也需处理（发票少算或重算漏项）。差异不能只报一个总数，必须<strong>归因到具体字段</strong>，否则申诉无法被承运人接受。归因维度通常四类：起算基准错误（用 ATA 而非 availability）、日历口径错误（工作日按日历日算）、费率版本错误（用新版 tariff）、未扣除抗辩时段。每类归因对应申诉包里的一段证据链。</p>\n<p>追回率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Recovery Rate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>已追回</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>已识别</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Recovery Rate} = \\sum \\Delta_{\\text{已追回}} / \\sum \\Delta_{\\text{已识别}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recovery Rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">已追回</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">已识别</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是衡量引擎效果的运营指标。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 的容差不应设为零：进位、汇率、时区边界会带来小额噪声，容差按金额绝对值与百分比双阈值设定，低于阈值放行，否则进入归因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"争议申诉的数据支撑与追回闭环\">争议申诉的数据支撑与追回闭环</h2><p>稽核引擎的产出不是一份「发票错了」的报告，而是一个<strong>可直接提交的申诉包</strong>。承运人受理争议时要求说明争议箱号、金额、理由与证据，数据模型的作用是自动组装：从事件表取时间戳证据，从合同表取条款依据，从归因与重算结果取争议理由与金额。申诉包的最小结构包括箱号与 B/L、争议金额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>、归因类别、支撑事件（带来源标识的原始时间戳）、合同条款引用。把字段结构化还有个好处：<strong>申诉接受率可被度量</strong>——某类归因接受率长期偏低说明规则过宽需收紧，接受率高但触发量少说明阈值过严、漏掉了可追回金额。</p>\n<p>追回闭环需与财务系统对接，把「已识别」与「已追回」分开记账，状态机经过识别（identified）→ 申诉中（disputed）→ 已接受（accepted）→ 已入账（credited）或已驳回（rejected）。只有在收到承运人贷项通知（credit note）或调整后发票时，才能把金额从「已识别」转入「已追回」——识别不等于追回，这一区分是评估体系可信度的底线。</p>\n<p>争议时限是不可逆的：承运人合同与 FMC 46 CFR 541 都对申诉时效有要求，逾期即丧失抗辩权。引擎调度不应只在发票到达时运行一次，而须持续监控每张未结发票的<strong>申诉窗口剩余天数</strong>并提前触发；这一调度与事件时间线的实时采集同源，可复用 <a href=\"../free-time-clock-event-tracking/dd-clock-model-container-event-timeline\">免费期时钟模型与集装箱事件时间线</a> 的事件管道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落地时的工程约束\">落地时的工程约束</h2><p>把上述模型投入生产，最容易失败的地方不在算法，而在数据接入与规则治理。以下几点值得在架构阶段就固定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>事件时间戳必须有来源标识</strong>。同一事件可能来自码头 EDI、承运人门户、第三方追踪服务，三者会不一致。保留来源而非做「最优猜测」，让规则层显式处理冲突。</li>\n<li><strong>规则按承运人 × 港口 × 合同版本三级组织</strong>。规则爆炸是必然的，但应发生在数据层而非代码层，声明式 DSL 是让业务人员可审阅与修改的前提；FMC 46 CFR 541 的要素清单也可能随修订变化，L1 检查的字段集同样应可配置。</li>\n<li><strong>时区与港口日历是一等公民</strong>。跨时区日期边界、工作日口径、夏令时切换都会移动免费期起止点，应建模为可注入配置而非散落常量。</li>\n<li><strong>只追加的事件日志与可回溯的金额</strong>。任何重算结果都应记录当时使用的规则版本、tariff 版本与事件集合，否则事后无法解释一笔追回金额的由来。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>D&amp;D 可稽核化的本质是一次数据建模：把承运人的<strong>账单</strong>、码头的<strong>事件</strong>、合同的<strong>条款</strong>拆成可独立验证的事实表，再用分层规则引擎重算与比对。关键取舍有四：发票是<strong>待验证的声明</strong>，L1 结构检查（对应 FMC 46 CFR 541 要素要求）是唯一允许整票退回的层；重算的每一项都必须落到模型字段，缺失即标记为不可验证；差异必须归因到具体字段，归因是申诉被承运人接受的前提；「已识别」与「已追回」分两本账，只有收到贷项通知才划转。落地成败更多取决于事件时间戳的来源治理、规则的三级版本化与时区/港口日历的建模，而非重算算法本身；且争议时效不可逆，引擎须持续监控未结发票的申诉窗口。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"滞箱费账单数据模型与自动稽核规则引擎","id":"滞箱费账单数据模型与自动稽核规则引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：发票是待验证的声明，不是既成事实","id":"核心概念-发票是待验证的声明-不是既成事实"},{"level":2,"text":"账单数据模型：把一票 D&D 拆成五张事实表","id":"账单数据模型-把一票-d-d-拆成五张事实表"},{"level":2,"text":"自动稽核规则引擎的分层设计","id":"自动稽核规则引擎的分层设计"},{"level":2,"text":"费率重算与差异归因","id":"费率重算与差异归因"},{"level":2,"text":"争议申诉的数据支撑与追回闭环","id":"争议申诉的数据支撑与追回闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"落地时的工程约束","id":"落地时的工程约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"时钟异常与暂停顺延：停摆、假日、终端关闭与时间戳对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/free-time-clock-event-tracking/clock-exceptions-stop-and-adjust"},"next":{"title":"争议申诉流程设计与证据包构建（申诉窗口/承运人门户/SLA）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/invoice-audit-dispute-recovery/dd-dispute-filing-evidence-package"}}